y Lord and advise you; and I know from Allāh what you do not know.","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":62,"sd":null},{"k":"7:63","t":"Then do you wonder that there has come to you a reminder from your Lord through a man from among you, that he may warn you and that you may fear Allāh so you might receive mercy?\"","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":63,"sd":null},{"k":"7:64","t":"But they denied him, so We saved him and those who were with him in the ship. And We drowned those who denied Our signs. Indeed, they were a blind people.","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":64,"sd":null},{"k":"7:65","t":"And to the ʿAad [We sent] their brother Hūd. He said, \"O my people, worship Allāh; you have no deity other than Him. Then will you not fear Him?\"","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":65,"sd":null},{"k":"7:66","t":"Said the eminent ones who disbelieved among his people, \"Indeed, we see you in foolishness, and indeed, we think you are of the liars.\"","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":66,"sd":null},{"k":"7:67","t":"[Hūd] said, \"O my people, there is not foolishness in me, but I am a messenger from the Lord of the worlds.","j":8,"h":16,"s":7,"a":67,"sd":null}],"juz":8,"hizb":16,"surahs":[7],"sajdah":false}